              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U-Ahithofeli wathi ku-Abisalomu: “Mangikhethe amadoda ayizinkulungwane eziyishumi nambili, ngisuke ngixoshe uDavide ngalobu busuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.1",
